          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Aŋeyo ticci ducu, mar ma itye kwede, niyeni ki ticci me konyo dano, ki kit ma idiyo kwede cwinyi. Aŋeyo ni ticci ma kombeddi itye ka tiyone kato me kare mukwoŋo ca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
