                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abineko litinone woko bene, wek lwak ma guye an i kabedo ducu guŋe ni an aŋiyo cwiny dano wa ki tamgi, dok abimiyo bot dano acel acel i kinwu gin ma lubo kit tic ma en otiyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
